{"2377720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Power Racing", "steam_appid": 2377720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/89c04639e14165b29e8f31c52c3e6530.avif?t=1787884619\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blow up rivals with missiles and mines in chaotic top down combat racing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap a bomb to your roof in <strong>Timebomb</strong>, splat zombies, smash through <strong>destructible tracks, </strong>escape the police!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the rush in 12 vehicles (3 starter + 9 unlockable)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast through 9 tracks (8 starter + 1 unlockable)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade + 2 seasons of career mode + the driving school (more coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate rivals in 3 main modes (Timebomb, Speed Race, Power Race) + a special career event &quot;<strong>Zombo Blast</strong>&quot; and a Police chase</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/bbeb1cd7d377292dc8692a076894034e.avif?t=1787884619\" width=905 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from an unknown rookie in a drab garage to a champion in a state of the art garage, go from oil cans to plush sofas, a boring box to a rotating car platform and more. start learning your moves at the driving school before taking on the best of the best. Work your way to fame and watch your garage change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.poster.avif?t=1787884619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.webm?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/70aab4b9e50f37094e0bcdd17b6012eb.mp4?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40b5b46f78fff78d6c5f2ecbf07ba81f.avif?t=1787884619\" width=585 height=86 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock lots of different vehicles from compact cars to drift monsters and even ice cream vans. Vehicles can be unlocked in Career and Arcade mode, check the unlock screen to see how to unlock new content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.poster.avif?t=1787884619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.webm?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/0484a15bb09237a9b1cd92850b457b19.mp4?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/6e80d155fc702c729e3b5c1d43323dfa.avif?t=1787884619\" width=754 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out the competition using mines or missiles or simply land on top of them to take them out on fully destructible tracks. Expect to smash through barriers, boats, helicopters, signs and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.poster.avif?t=1787884619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.webm?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/40f7d5e464ae89f76d1fe315c7bcf45d.mp4?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/2ee6101a56fc28b2987f00f284699431.avif?t=1787884619\" width=678 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here in the Super Power Racing League we don't settle for just racing, we mix it up! Expect Power Races with weapons, speed boosts and oil slicks, Time bomb races were we strap a bomb on your roof and see how many checkpoints you can hit before you go boom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also sometimes zombies happen so it's time to take them out too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4438ddc9bc2.poster.avif?t=1787884619\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4438ddc9bc2.webm?t=1787884619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377720/extras/ba57532d2b1d166e8c57f4